## Git LFS
##
## The Kokoro ONNX model is ~310 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB hard file limit
## for regular git blobs, so it must be tracked through LFS. The voicepack
## .bin files are ~512 KB each (small enough for regular git), but tracking
## them via LFS too keeps the `models/` folder uniformly stored and makes
## `git clone --no-fetch-blobs` / `lfs.fetchexclude` filtering predictable
## for users who don't need TTS at checkout time.
##
## Source files for these blobs:
##   - kokoro-v1.0.onnx — onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/onnx/model.onnx
##   - models/voices/*.bin — onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/voices/<name>.bin
*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
models/voices/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
